error[parallel-write] 2:32-2:85
  (par (call inventory.items {}) (call mail.send {:to "ops@example.com" :subject "x"}))
                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  par runs in parallel, so it cannot call mail.send, which writes.
  Call writes outside par and par-map, one at a time.
  Help: sx help par
